WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.320
Someone once said:

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.290
There is a cut of meat that 
shines like a precious gem,

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:53.830
that combines the flavors 
of every cut of meat:

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:59.300
the moist tenderness of a fillet, 
the high-grade marbling of sirloin,

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.130
the firm texture of shoulder,

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:04.000
and the unique flavors of 
gizzards that get you hooked...

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.940
The Jewel Meat!

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:10.270
Ancient people used this treasured,

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:14.250
shining meat instead of a wedding ring.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.580
And in the present

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:19.880
a great number of people have set off 
on quests for this mystical meat!

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:23.120
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:27.590
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:32.600
Toriko and the others have made their 
way inside of the Regal Mammoth's body,

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:36.700
where they encountered the GT Robot 
controlled by Cedre in the stomach.

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:40.570
Sunny took up the challenge, and 
the others hurried on forward.

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:45.910
A fierce battled unfolded between 
Coco and the giant GT Robot,

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:52.880
while elsewhere, Starjun's GT Robot 
appeared in front of the waiting Terry.

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.890
Coco had his back against the 
wall with a bigger opponent,

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:58.920
but he succeeded in shooting aqua regia,

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:03.800
a chemical powerful enough to dissolve 
gold, into the GT Robot's core and won.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:10.100
But then, Starjun's GT Robot 
appeared before the collapsed Coco!

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:16.610
The Unyielding Aesthetic! 
Sunny's Manly Battle!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:29.520
Hey, what's wrong?

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.660
Chief!

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:34.730
It seems like no Jewel Meat exists 
inside this young mammoth.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:40.200
It takes decades for the Jewel Meat to grow.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.470
So this little Regal-chan 
hasn't got some yet?

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:48.410
We can only extract the 
Jewel Meat from the parent!

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:51.780
We have no choice but to wait for them!

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.180
Killed...

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:37.760
Someone... is going to be killed!

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:46.500
If Toriko-san doesn't eat something, 
we're going to be in trouble...

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.630
Oh, right! The Cream Mushrooms!

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:51.540
Huh? Where's the Gourmet Case?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.470
It must have fallen off when 
we fell into the stomach...

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:58.580
Those are...

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.210
This is orangesalt!

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:04.420
It's a tree that grows rocksalt like oranges.

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:10.150
I bet that seeds on the Regal Highlands 
entered the body and sprouted...

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:15.590
Ooh, it's salty and fruity!

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:17.900
Look what we have over here!

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.460
That's...

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.230
The stem is a cinnamon stick...

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:22.570
Cinnamontail!

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:27.270
The springlike taste of horsetail

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:29.710
mixes together with the 
sweet fragrance of cinnamon!

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:30.440
That's it!

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:36.410
If I crush it with this Gourmet Spicer 
and season some ingredient with it...

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:37.520
What are you doing?

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.380
Hurry up!

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:41.490
Something not right is going 
on inside the mammoth's body!

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:44.420
I can smell a strong acid in the air.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:48.330
A great deal of digestive acids 
are being produced in the stomach.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:52.160
That's proof that the mammoth is undergoing 
a tremendous amount of stress!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:57.340
It's similar to having your own 
life eaten away by some virus...

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:01.140
A rejection reaction to foreign 
objects invading its body!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.810
Damn you, mammoth!

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:06.480
You plan on spewing out all 
foreign objects inside of you?

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.550
Hurry, this way!

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.520
R-Right!

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:16.950
This sticky, clingy, unnerving 
presence I feel...

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:19.060
<i>He's</i> come inside!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.230
I've got to make sure not to run into him!

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:35.710
Hair Leash!

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:54.430
Spatula!

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:12.280
You could shoot 10,000 of those and 
you'll never hit me as long as you live.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:16.350
Instead of running around out there, 
try getting a little closer!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:20.590
Then you'll release that 
hideous monster again, right?

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:22.490
That thing's a real problem, you know?

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.230
I pretty much know your range, now.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:33.770
You can't keep using that 
power forever, am I right?

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:35.700
Damn him...

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:59.660
Now then! I'll take a nice little break, 
and wait until you're powerless.

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:05.500
I'll just be taking a gander at the 
collection I gathered on this island...

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:14.770
What are those?! Ew, gross!

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:19.180
They're eyeballs! From various beasts.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:23.510
Sick! I think I'm gonna 
be sick! Just die already!

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:27.620
It's my hobby to collect 
the eyeballs of beasts.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.460
Especially the pretty ones 
that take a liking to me!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:37.230
There are some eyeballs which keep moving 
for a while even after they're dead!

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:39.130
You disgust me!

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:43.770
This little eyeball's looking 
at me, see! How cute!

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:44.570
Damn you!

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:50.640
Oh yeah... There's one that's taken 
a liking to me inside the mammoth...

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.790
Mega Octopus (Molluscan 
Beast) Capture Level 25

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:04.120
Damn it!

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:08.490
This guy's eyeballs are pretty cute, too!

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.700
I'll pluck 'em out later.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:16.530
But before that, he's got a little job to do.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:27.780
Spatula!

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:35.090
Come on! Attack again and again!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:37.160
Use more tentacles!

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:40.530
However! Don't get too close now.

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.330
Do it while keeping some distance.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:44.960
Spatula!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.670
His range is about 20 meters.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:54.970
Since that monster needs 
all his hair in one place,

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:58.080
he can't use it except within 
3 meters for close combat.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:02.780
The power to control each strand 
of hair independently...

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:06.080
That's got to take a considerable 
amount of concentration.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.590
As long as we keep enough distance 
so he can't use that hair monster,

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:12.660
he'll eventually be too fatigued to use it!

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.830
I wonder when his battery will run out?

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.530
Get outta my way! Stop!

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.000
Hair Lock!

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:30.610
This octopus still has more?

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.520
Quit it already... This is annoying.

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:52.130
Crudely fighting 'til we reach the 
breaking point isn't beautiful...

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:55.570
Let's just settle who's 
on top once and for all.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.400
That is a beautiful conclusion.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:03.010
I've put down my weapons, so come at me!

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:08.050
Nice try putting on a brave face!

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:10.280
I've been waiting for this time!

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:15.050
Toriko, you okay?

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:15.890
Yeah...

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:19.560
Toriko-san...

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:28.630
His strength is draining too fast!

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:32.500
Could it be because of 
those Gourmet Cell things?

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.170
Gourmet Cells?

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:37.640
Y-Yes. Sunny-san mentioned them.

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:41.380
He said that Toriko and 
the others carry them.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:43.980
The cells make it so the 
more delicious food you eat,

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:46.520
the more superhuman you become...

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:49.350
But there seem to be large risks!

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:52.220
Gourmet Cells... I've heard of them.

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:56.890
They're the legend that was discovered 
by the Gourmet God, Acacia.

00:11:56.890 --> 00:12:00.060
A-Acacia? Who's that?

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:13.340
Acacia? Who's that?

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:19.120
The person named Acacia was 
once known as the Gourmet God.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.890
A legendary Gourmet Hunter.

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:23.660
He had tasted nearly every 
ingredient in the world,

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:26.920
so they say he set forth to 
the depths of the oceans.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:30.060
There, he saw paradise!

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:33.800
But it was not some dazzling scenery,

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:37.070
but the taste of a fish which lived there.

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:41.910
He was at a loss for words.

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:45.040
The fish's heaping-helping 
of deliciousness...

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:47.410
The tastiness that could not be described...

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:50.850
The unbelievable pleasure 
spread throughout his body.

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:56.150
Perhaps I have been dead until now.

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:01.290
After that he began to research.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:05.600
I've never seen such delicious 
flavor constituents such as this...

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:12.070
And the vital activity of 
these cells is off the charts!

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:17.580
Where do these normally 
get their energy from?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:22.550
After much research, Acacia 
discovered the cause.

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:28.690
A jellyfish which slowly evolves, 
regenerating again and again.

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:33.290
The fish in the paradise at the bottom 
of the sea had eaten those jellyfish.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:36.790
Acacia named it the Gourmet Jellyfish.

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:43.330
The fish that ate these jellyfish had 
their special delicious flavors enhanced!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:47.640
Furthermore, in the creatures 
that ate the jellyfish,

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:50.740
the regenerative ability and vital activity

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:55.450
increased the more they ate delicious food.

00:13:55.450 --> 00:14:00.720
Incredible! This could be 
called the evolution of life!

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:07.860
Acacia named the cells from the 
Gourmet Jellyfish, Gourmet Cells.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.190
That's how the legend goes.

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:15.970
It's even more dangerous than before!

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:18.640
Coco's poison might be weakening!

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:19.470
Let's hurry!

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:32.020
This feels great!

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:35.120
You can't even fight back!

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:46.530
I've wanted to punch your 
smug face this whole time!

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.070
I can't move...

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:52.400
Same for me.

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:59.110
I wanted to smash in your 
hideous face since the start.

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:01.750
Y-You... You could still move?

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.310
You tricked me!

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:06.180
Come on, Octupus! Attack, attack!

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:07.220
No use!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:13.520
It hasn't taken a liking to 
you... It's afraid of you.

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:21.100
Oh crap... Look what showed up...

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:30.340
I took your attack.  Now you try taking mine.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.910
I'd rather not...

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.710
20,000 Strand...

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.720
Hair Punch!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:47.690
You're definitely built pretty tough.

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:51.130
Not being busted to pieces from 
my 20,000 Strand Hair Punch?

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.700
I think I'm in shock!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:56.400
Y-You damn brat...

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:59.800
It's my turn to attack next!

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:02.510
Oh, yeah? I don't think so!

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:04.810
It's always my turn!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.510
Wouldn't you say something like that?

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:08.850
You little...

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:11.550
Oh right, I almost forgot.

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:16.020
When I landed the Hair Punch, I 
inserted feelers into your body.

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:21.930
Tens of thousands of feelers are 
constricting your moving parts.

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:23.930
I gotta get distance...

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:27.570
If I get hit by that punch again, 
I might really be in trouble!

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:29.600
Let me give you a little warning.

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:32.470
Gotta get out of his range! 
Far outta his range!

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:36.570
It'd behoove you not to go far 
away from me. You'll regret it.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:43.080
See what I told you?

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:46.480
Well, this way of winning 
does lack some beauty,

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:50.150
but compared to fighting 
while you're running away...

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:54.290
I-Impossible! H-How did you get into my core?

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:55.430
How?

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:58.500
My feelers are 0.1 microns wide.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:01.530
They can easily enter into a 
gap the size of a follicle.

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:06.200
Then why didn't you aim for 
my core from the start?

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:07.940
Isn't it obvious?!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:13.650
You're so disgusting I didn't want to 
have to touch your insides, that's all!

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.500
Man, I'm beat!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:37.370
Man, how long has it been since 
I was punched in the face?

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:40.640
One of these days I'm gonna 
slug you in the flesh!

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.940
What the...

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:52.980
Sunny!

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:53.890
Kiss!

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:01.090
What? This is... Kiss?

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.530
What are you doing, Sunny?

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:07.870
I got this wound because I 
tripped inside the mammoth!

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:10.070
It's not that I was hit by the 
enemy or anything, got it?!

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:12.840
Sure, I got it. All that 
matters is that you're safe.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:15.840
I just tripped at really high speed!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:16.640
Sure.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:19.740
But the enemy was a piece of 
cake! I wiped the floor with him!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.950
So the shadow of death 
I saw wasn't Sunny's...

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:23.980
The problem is...

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:26.350
...him.

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:28.690
Who in Toriko's group did I 
see the shadow of death from?

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:31.720
Let's hurry, Sunny! Toriko 
and the others are in danger!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:37.360
Hey, what's wrong, Coco? You of all 
people are barely able to stand?!

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.260
Looks like you had a rough time.

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.970
I used too much poison.

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:45.070
Did Kiss bring this food?

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:47.810
Why don't we rest a little longer?

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:48.710
But...

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:52.480
Sorry, but I'm seriously taking a break!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:56.410
Or rather, there's no <i>way</i> I'm 
going back in that mammoth!

00:18:56.950 --> 00:19:00.120
Sunny, there's an enemy 
inside that mammoth which...

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:03.090
You've always been such a worrywart.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:09.760
You and I have already served our purposes.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:14.300
I think we should entrust Toriko 
in getting the Jewel Meat.

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:18.270
In fact, if we went to rescue 
him, wouldn't Toriko be insulted?

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.240
Even if someone dies?

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.340
You're saying Toriko will lose?

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:30.280
Believe in him. That's the 
beautiful thing to do.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.060
Take a right up there!

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:42.760
Toriko-san, look at this place!

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:47.070
The insides are shining because 
of the dazzling Jewel Meat!

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:48.870
Amazing!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:53.770
So the reason there's light inside the 
body is all because of the Jewel Meat?

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:56.170
I can smell an extra large 
helping of delicious!

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:59.310
The Jewel Meat is close!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:06.850
Out of the way, Komatsu!

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:09.250
Move!

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:11.090
Toriko?!

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:17.930
My full-on intimidation 
didn't budge him an inch!

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:19.660
5-Fold!

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:36.980
Toriko!

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:43.320
Oh? You grazed me?

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:49.960
Fragrance Bazooka!

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:05.440
Toriko-san!

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.610
Rin-san!

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:27.070
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:33.300
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:40.550
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:45.520
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:50.620
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.990
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:21:53.990 --> 00:21:58.460
on a journey with no end!

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:03.430
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:03.430 --> 00:22:06.540
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:12.580
amid the waves of time.

00:22:15.510 --> 00:22:17.520
Gourmet News!

00:22:18.320 --> 00:22:20.080
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:23.050
The Orangesalt trees that 
grow on the Regal Highlands

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:26.960
grow a fruity rocksalt with the 
smell of lemons and acid taste!

00:22:28.730 --> 00:22:31.100
Crush them, and use them for cooking!

00:22:33.100 --> 00:22:35.830
By the way, once in a certain country,

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:38.440
when an enemy country ran out 
of salt and was in trouble,

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:41.010
they sent some orangesalts,

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:44.010
but they were mistaken for normal oranges

00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:44.080
and sent to fruit stores, or so I hear.

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:51.920
Everyone searched around for them, but 
in the end no one could find them...

00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:54.490
Orange you glad I shared 
that salty tale with you?

00:22:57.560 --> 00:22:59.560
I know, that was sad...

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:04.300
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:08.640
Toriko! Rin! Wake up!

00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:10.210
What do I do...?!

00:23:10.210 --> 00:23:12.430
Oh! Rin's trying to say something!

00:23:12.930 --> 00:23:16.810
Rin's Final Wish! Awaken, Super Toriko!

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:18.850
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
